   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Those should all be easy to fix.\r<br>\r<br>Yes, we don&#39;t want any use of std::cout or std::cerr.\r<br>Either throw exceptions or write to the message stream.\r<br>Otherwise, we can&#39;t get output back to R.\r<br>\r<br>I&#39;ll create a branch and fix the issues before 2.0.0.\r<br>\r<br>- Bob\r<br>"
    ],
